      <h2>My service is right for you if…</h2>
      <ul class="hv-aud-list">
        <li>You want to plan a trip to Thailand but don&#x27;t know where to start.</li>
        <li>You want to avoid common mistakes and tourist traps.</li>
        <li>You want authentic spots and local tips, off the beaten path.</li>
        <li>You want a well-organized trip while keeping the freedom to choose.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn-teal mt-l" href="/en/contact/"><span>Get my free quote</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

