<section class="section-pad hv-why">
  <div class="container hv-why-grid">
    <div class="hv-why-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 45vw, 100vw" src="/images/anais-bureau.jpg" alt="Anaïs on the phone at her desk, notebook open"></div>
    <div class="hv-why-text">
    <div class="hv-head">
      <h2>Why work with a travel planner?</h2>
      <p>Not a travel agency, not a standardized tour. Personal support, from your first message to your return home.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hv-cols">
      <div data-reveal><h3>Not a packaged trip</h3><p>An agency sells the same tour to everyone. Your itinerary starts from you: your pace, what you love, what you'd rather avoid.</p></div>
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1"><h3>The best prices, found for you</h3><p>Flights, hotels, activities, transport, even where to eat. I compare everything and you book at the direct price, with no agency margin.</p></div>
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2"><h3>We actually talk</h3><p>Calls to build the trip together, step by step, for as long as it takes. Then I stay on WhatsApp for the whole trip.</p></div>
      <div data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3"><h3>Someone who lives there</h3><p>In Koh Lanta since February 2023. Seasons, routes and good addresses, I know them from the inside.</p></div>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

