<section class="section-pad hv-process">
  <div class="container hv-proc-grid">
    <div class="hv-proc-photo"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/IMG_6422.jpg" alt="Bird's eye view over Ang Thong bay"></div>
    <div>
      <div class="hv-head">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
        <p>Six simple steps, from our first exchange to your return home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps steps-line" data-reveal>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Get in touch</h3><p>Tell me about your trip idea by email, form or social media.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Discovery call</h3><p>Free and no obligation. We talk about what you want, your budget and your dates.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Tailor-made itinerary</h3><p>I put together one or two proposals tailored to your project, with a clear quote.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Trip design</h3><p>Selection of transport, accommodation and activities suited to your style.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">05</div><h3>Travel journal</h3><p>You receive your complete guide with everything you need to book with confidence.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><div class="step-num">06</div><h3>Enjoy your trip!</h3><p>I stay available 7 days a week during your stay. All you have to do is enjoy.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

